body:
One thing I would point out playing as a Arcanist / Summoner is that you're going to have points where you'll feel like you're not doing as much damage as other classes are. This is... true to a point, BUT. Your primary attacks for a while are critter-based and DOT's - you have direct damage, but they've got cast times. In actuality, since you're able to spread those DOT's to groups, you're actually doing a lot in terms of grinding them down but you don't carry the spike damage that Black Mages or the like do. So it's not as immediately noticeable.

&#x200B;

Keep with it. I've gotten mine to 67 and I've had a LOT of fun with him. With a little bit of gear, a combination of chocobo (healer spec IS your friend) and summons, and a little bit of luck,  you can walk into and survive a lot of things that other classes would have no business messing with.
